WEBVTT

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.060
A boat?

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:47.500
Looking at the passenger list, there were 267 on board.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.570
They all disappeared?

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:55.150
The statue of Perseus and
Euryale's Eyes were on board.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:03:00.510
What idiot put together two objects
that should have been kept apart, oni?

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:04.010
We can't handle the enemy
by ourselves this time.

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:05.640
We need his help.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:07.230
But he's...

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:08.850
We'll have to wake him up.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:15.270
Well, it's for Alma as well.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:37.510
Di...

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:43.050
Di... D... D... Di... Di...

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:47.270
Outta my way.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.640
I know. It's all gone.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.020
Good morning, Tandoji.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:56.610
Hey!

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.610
Wakana, don't talk to him.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.410
Look here!

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.740
Why greet him, of all people?

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.030
You think?

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:10.710
Yeah, you only hear
bad rumors about that guy.

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:15.590
Man, you could have
gotten 20,000 yen.

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:18.550
You only had to say "Die, Alma!"

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.630
So you're fined
10,000 yen.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:21.630
That can't be!

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:23.380
Your family's got money.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:24.970
That's none of your business.

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.470
Is that so?

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:28.600
Tandoji...

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.100
Wh-What?

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:33.900
Hey, what are you looking at?

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.770
What do you want, Tandoji?

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:39.900
Nothing.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:54.120
Tandoji...

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.520
Hey!

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:17.060
Daydreaming here again.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:17.810
Whoa.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.400
She's defenseless...

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.820
So, about joining
the stone club?

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:23.530
Have you thought about it?

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:25.610
Come on, you don't have
to respond so quickly.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:29.410
Tandoji, you always
look for stones in the river.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:30.830
Well, that's...

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.080
Today...

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.080
we're all going to
the art museum.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:39.540
The stones in the inner garden,
they're really pretty!

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:43.800
Tandoji, I have a feeling you'll like them.
So why don't we go together?

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:44.590
No, that's alright.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.090
Oh come on!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:47.680
Okay, let's stop there.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.810
Excuse us.
She's lost her marbles.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.850
I'll be waiting for you
at the Hinode Park bus stop!

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.430
Let's go, Wakana.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:56.060
Excuse us.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.100
5:30, I'll be waiting for you!

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.900
I'll keep waiting for you!

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.610
Hey, Wakana.

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:08.990
Why are you talking
to that guy?

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:12.700
If he joins the stone club,
that's going to cause a lot of trouble.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.910
Trouble?

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.040
Didn't he send a punk
to the hospital?

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:19.420
Who knows what he'll do
if he loses it.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:20.170
You know.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:21.840
That's only a rumor.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:25.010
I've never seen him
doing anything wrong.

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:28.680
He goes to the river
a lot to look for stones.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:33.560
There's no such thing as a bad person
who likes stones. That's my philosophy.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.570
Road A, closure complete.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:45.780
Road B, closure complete.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.200
Road C, closure complete.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.910
Alright. Stay there
until the mission is complete.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.160
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:55.040
Snipers, status?

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:57.200
Point Alpha. Standby OK.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:59.830
Point Bravo. Standby OK.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.130
<i>I'll give the order once we arrive.</i>

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.540
<i>Wait for my command.</i>

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:04.800
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:08.260
Miss Ruri, we're on standby.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.180
Let's go.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.970
We're on our way.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:19.730
Alma?

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.070
Are you Alma Tandoji?

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:24.820
Who're you?

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:28.280
This is Ruri Aiba.
CEO of Aiba Foundation.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:30.200
And I am her butler, Kagami.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.820
Oni-gawara, oni.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:32.990
What do you want?

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:36.740
I want you to
lend me your powers.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:37.700
Powers?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:43.080
The other day, a large passenger vessel
exploded off the Miura peninsula.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:44.960
Were you aware of this?

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:46.590
Yeah...

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:51.300
It was caused by a
creature we call Dark Stone.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:52.180
What?

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.680
Pretty soon, the Dark Stone will cause
a catastrophic disaster.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:58.810
To avoid this,
we need your power.

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:00.980
I'm not interested in joining you.
Get outta here.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:03.850
Alma, please give us the
slumbering power within--

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.900
I have no idea
what you're saying.

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:08.150
The power you used
three years ago!

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.190
You can't hide it.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:14.570
We know everything
there is to know about you.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:20.160
Alma Tandoji, 17, Shinminato Academy
second year, average grades.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:24.130
When you were fourteen
you had a violent episode.

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:28.300
You heavily injured eighteen students
and were suspended for half a year.

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.760
Currently under probation.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:31.720
Stop...

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:35.140
Your father is unknown.
You were born to an unwed mother.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.010
Since she died in an accident ten years ago,
you've been placed in various orphanages--

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:41.020
What do you want?

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.140
You should stay away from me!

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.060
Alma!

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:43.890
Let me explain!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.690
I already told you,
stay away from me!

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:49.860
Ready?

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:52.150
Bravo, ready.

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:54.240
Alpha, ready.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:08:59.950
Why?

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:08.710
W-wait. Oh no, oni.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.800
<i>He's much more powerful then I imagined, oni!</i>

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:14.090
<i>Get out of there immediately, oni!</i>

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:17.760
<i>If not, we're all done for, oni.</i>

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.060
Please...

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:23.230
stay away...

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:26.400
from me!

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:35.150
Miss Ruri, let's leave for now.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:50.290
Ruri, if we continue
he'll kill us, oni.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:54.670
No, I believe in him.

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:57.970
Damn it.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.680
What an awful day.

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:05.140
We're at Arcade 2nd Street.
There's a monster approaching--

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:18.990
What is it? My heart's racing.

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.120
What's all the commotion?

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.250
Wakana, are you really
waiting for him?

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.960
He'll never come.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.120
I know he will.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.750
Do what you want to do.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.250
Well, we're going to go.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.050
OK.

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:39.720
I know he'll come.
He'll be here.

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:44.890
<i>It appears the Dark Stone in on the move again.</i>

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:45.850
What?

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:47.850
<i>Emergency formation now!</i>

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:50.860
<i>Also, prepare the freight helicopter and the Engagement suit.</i>

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:52.060
Yes, sir.

00:10:55.860 --> 00:11:00.910
Dark Stone spotted at the coastal park.
Moving in a SE direction at 3 km per hour.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:02.030
<i>Roger that.</i>

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.990
<i>Bring the copter to the rendezvous point.</i>

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.160
Yes, sir. Awaiting coordinates.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.370
<i>Thirty-five point two seven one six.</i>

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:10.420
<i>One three nine point three six one.</i>

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:14.040
Estimated arrival at rendezvous
point, ten minutes.

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:15.210
<i>Roger that.</i>

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:16.300
<i>Over and out.</i>

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:19.380
Good luck.

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:22.260
We're just a bit late, Oni-gawara.

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:26.310
It's Alma's fault I didn't
detect the Dark Stone sooner,oni.

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.420
Over there?

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:56.090
<i>I'll be waiting for you
at the Hinode Park bus stop!</i>

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:00.420
<i>Stay away from me!</i>

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:06.060
<i>I'll keep waiting for you!</i>

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.440
For now...

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.780
Move!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:18.570
Me!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:39.670
What is this?

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:42.090
My heart keeps racing.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:43.590
I gotta get there fast.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:51.270
Mr. Kagami, I'm sending data related
to the stones at the Dark Stone's destination.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.140
Roger that.

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:57.150
Get me more data
about this area.

00:12:57.230 --> 00:12:59.610
Roger. Getting data on the
Morizono Art Museum.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:03.200
Currently there's an exhibit
on the Eye of Stheno.

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.320
Oh no, oni!

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:09.450
Medusa had two sisters who had
the power of immortality, oni.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:13.160
One, Euryale. The other Stheno.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:16.750
Medusa already has
Euryale's powers.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:20.170
If she gets Stheno's powers,
we'll be outmatched.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:22.260
Wow, that must be expensive.

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:23.550
It says half a billion.

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:27.680
The inner garden stone was nice, but being
able to see this makes it all worthwhile.

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.300
Your attention, please.
I know.

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:33.480
This is an emergency.
We apologize for the interruption.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.150
Please evacuate the premises.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:37.560
Please follow the maid closest to you.
What should we do?

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:40.150
We appreciate your cooperation.
Let's get a hold of Wakana for now.

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:43.070
Oh, it's Ageha.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:45.650
Yes, hello.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:47.610
He... Wa... what... ? Where are...

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:49.830
Oh, the call dropped.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:53.370
What? It's out of range.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:54.290
Excuse me.

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:57.330
Please move towards
the piston bus.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.040
Oh yes, right away.

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:01.210
How is the evacuation going?

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:03.630
<i>Everything is proceeding systematically.</i>

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:05.800
How's the acquisition
of the Eye of Stheno?

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:09.510
<i>We're offering twice the previous purchase price but the owner hasn't responded.</i>

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.100
Make it three times and if they still won't
accept, call it off.

00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:13.520
<i>Understood, sir.</i>

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:17.640
I'll get Medusa before
she gets to Stheno.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.610
I'm counting on you, Kagami.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:23.360
Just in case,
I'm contacting Alma.

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:26.530
<i>Hey, hey. You still believe in him, oni?</i>

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:28.660
I understand.

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:30.280
<i>I'll have the snipers--</i>

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.370
That won't be necessary.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.370
Ruri, your life is
in danger, oni.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:34.370
I don't care.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:41.540
If I can't save him here,
that means my powers are useless.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:44.420
Understood.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.300
I'll try my best as well.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:01.190
<i>Provide backup to Miss Ruri instead of returning to the estate.</i>

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:02.400
Yes, sir.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:09.110
<i>Breaking news. This just in.</i>

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:12.570
<i>An emergency alert has been announced for the city of Yokosuka.</i>

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:14.580
<i>It appears the residents are evacuating.</i>

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:17.580
<i>Kobayashi is on the scene. Can you tell what's going on?</i>

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:20.120
No announcements from
the police bureau yet.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.880
It's unclear what
is happening--

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:26.340
As you can see there's been
continuous sporadic fire bursts.

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.260
Hey! You!

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:30.260
<i>You can't go there, the roads are--</i>

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:46.780
Did that work?

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.760
Engagement Suit,
main system is down.

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:15.220
<i>Mr. Kagami, please respond.</i>

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:17.180
<i>Mr. Kagami?</i>

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:20.350
I'm OK. Running on
the backup system.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.230
How's the Dark Stone?

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:26.440
Currently it's moving far outside
of the guarded area.

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:27.820
What's going on?!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.360
<i>This way, oni.</i>

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.490
The target has switched to Ruri, oni.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.700
It's trying to devour both
Ruri and the pendant, oni.

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:38.410
Because this stone has more
power than Euryale, oni.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:41.790
On top of that, if it eats Ruri
it'll become immortal, oni.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.540
Not on my watch!

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.920
I might not make it.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:52.670
I was so sure he was
going to come.

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:56.640
Tandoji?

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:58.350
You came!

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:06.690
Hey!

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:09.270
You OK?

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:16.870
It was him?

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.860
This is Alma's...

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:16.470
<i>Currently above Hinode City.</i>

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:19.970
<i>Visual of two Dark Stones in combat, appears to be Medusa and Alma Tandoji.</i>

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:23.890
I'll arrive in five minutes.
Maintain your position until then.

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.020
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:27.600
She's going to do
something crazy.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:28.690
I have to hurry.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.440
Miss Ruri.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:33.360
Attend to the wounded and
call an ambulance, now!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:34.860
As you wish.

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.560
Like I thought,
a Dark Stone is a Dark Stone.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.690
Losing himself.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:14.360
Let them be!

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:16.400
But Miss Ruri!

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:19.820
Alma!

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:21.160
Stop!

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:31.540
I beg of you!

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.750
Wake up!

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:39.090
Not again.

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:42.550
I let it happen again.

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.180
The same thing.

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:52.400
I only hurt people
with my power.

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:54.020
I don't need this.

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:56.150
I don't want this.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.110
Disappear and get
away from me.

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:00.030
This power!

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:02.860
No!

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:06.200
There's no such thing
as unnecessary power.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.830
I'm going to awaken
your true power right now!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:13.540
The power of Sacred Seven!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:18.710
Your memories
I take into me.

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:23.010
My Soul...

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:28.520
I give to you!

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:43.160
So this is my true... power?

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.160
<i>Mr. Kagami, we were unsuccessful with the Stheno acquisition.</i>

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.870
<i>That stupid greedy owner, he messed up everything, oni.</i>

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.250
Whoa! That was fast.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:58.090
Ruri, you're going to have a
gigantic object flying toward you, oni.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:05.510
Well, for now,

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:07.930
I'll accept your Soul.

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:12.100
<i>Alma...</i>

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.940
<i>An unpopulated area.</i>

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:26.110
<i>Alma! Destroy the two cores simultaneously, oni!</i>

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:28.530
Core?

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:30.950
That must be it!

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:34.960
Simultaneously.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:36.880
The power to destroy two.

00:21:57.940 --> 00:21:59.980
Shatter to pieces!

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:28.090
A concussion?

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:32.060
Phew, I'm so glad you got away
with only minor cuts otherwise.

00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:35.600
But you know, if Tandoji came earlier
you wouldn't have been in this mess.

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:39.850
Well, I'm just glad
that he came.

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:44.730
I have a feeling he's going
to join the stone club.

00:23:12.350 --> 00:23:13.100
Whoa!

00:23:15.680 --> 00:23:17.230
Knock it off.

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:19.060
I'm talking to <i>you</i>!

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:24.690
Um...

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:27.070
Thanks, Tandoji.

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:32.700
<i>Stonehounding Club</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.040
Hey!

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:44.340
I knew you'd come.

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:48.050
Just your luck. There are some other
people who want to join the club.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:50.760
You guys!

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:52.050
Oh, you know them?

00:23:52.390 --> 00:23:55.810
We joined so we
could be with you.

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:58.270
But you guys aren't
from this school.

00:23:58.270 --> 00:24:01.730
As of today I'm the president
of the student council.

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:03.360
And she's the Chairperson of the Board.

00:24:03.360 --> 00:24:04.770
What?

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:08.030
It was easier to purchase the whole school,
so that's what I did.

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:11.280
For real?

00:24:11.860 --> 00:24:14.280
Yes, for real, oni!

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:29.590
Ruri's Sky-Blue Bond
